  <section id="esp32-series-soc-errata">
<h1>ESP32 Series SoC Errata<a class="headerlink" href="#esp32-series-soc-errata" title="Permalink to this heading"></a></h1>
<p><a class="reference external" href="../../../zh_CN/latest/esp32/index.html">[中文]</a></p>
<p>This document describes known errata in <a class="reference external" href="https://www.espressif.com/en/products/socs?id=ESP32">ESP32</a> series of SoCs.</p>
<p>It consists of the following major chapters:</p>
<ul class="simple">
<li><dl class="simple">
<dt><a class="reference internal" href="01-chip-identification/index.html"><span class="doc">Chip Revision Identification</span></a></dt><dd><ul>
<li><p>Introduces how to identify a specific ESP32 chip revision, or a batch of chips and products built around the ESP32 chips which contains error fixes described in this document.</p></li>
</ul>
</dd>
</dl>
</li>
<li><dl class="simple">
<dt><a class="reference internal" href="02-errata-summary/index.html"><span class="doc">Errata Summary</span></a></dt><dd><ul>
<li><p>Overview of all bugs and their affected chip revisions.</p></li>
</ul>
</dd>
</dl>
</li>
<li><dl class="simple">
<dt><a class="reference internal" href="03-errata-description/index.html"><span class="doc">All Errata Descriptions</span></a></dt><dd><ul>
<li><p>Detailed bug descriptions, including conditions, expected behaviors and actual behaviors, causes, influences on users, workarounds, and solutions.</p></li>
</ul>
</dd>
</dl>
</li>
<li><dl class="simple">
<dt><a class="reference internal" href="_tags/tagsindex.html"><span class="doc">Errata Descriptions by Chip Revisions</span></a></dt><dd><ul>
<li><p>Classification of bug descriptions by chip revisions.</p></li>
</ul>
</dd>
</dl>
</li>
<li><dl class="simple">
<dt><a class="reference internal" href="revision-history/index.html"><span class="doc">Revision History</span></a></dt><dd><ul>
<li><p>The release notes for this document.</p></li>
</ul>
</dd>
</dl>
</li>
</ul>
<p>To switch to another chip, use the drop-down menu at the top left of the page.</p>
<div class="toctree-wrapper compound">
</div>
<div class="toctree-wrapper compound">
</div>
</section>


